            1234,
            1237
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " Although the SipHash algorithm is considered to be generally strong,",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1238,
            1310
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " it is not intended for cryptographic purposes. As such, all",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
